Scene tuning: CC0-1.0 (public domain dedication)

The tuning files in this directory describe how the room artwork in
../artwork is animated. To the extent any rights exist, they are dedicated to
the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, together with the scene loops and
sound beds rendered from them at build time. See ../artwork/LICENSE and
../../LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt. The application code is GPL-3.0-or-later.
